    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME partnered with TDF MagnifiScience Centre to host an innovative workshop known as \"Rescue Rangers: Junior Doctor Adventure.\" The goal of this unique event was to be both educational and exciting, providing an opportunity for participants to develop crucial first aid skills and critical thinking abilities.",
